{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01570",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 4.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.47,
      "end_seconds": 10.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.72,
      "end_seconds": 28.28,
      "duration_seconds": 17.56,
      "text": "I'm here because of a pulled muscle in my thigh. I thought it would sort itself out, um, but it hasn't. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.09,
      "end_seconds": 34.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "When did this begin? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.35,
      "end_seconds": 39.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I've had it for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.16,
      "end_seconds": 44.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Alright, what eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.0,
      "end_seconds": 56.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "It settles a little with ice. A bit of bruising was there, you know, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.41,
      "end_seconds": 64.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Have you had a pulled muscle in your thigh before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.69,
      "end_seconds": 73.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "Yes, you know, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.47,
      "end_seconds": 77.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.78,
      "end_seconds": 88.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.45,
      "end_seconds": 112.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 116 over 73, pulse is 69 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.96,
      "end_seconds": 118.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.97,
      "end_seconds": 131.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.22,
      "end_seconds": 133.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.16,
      "end_seconds": 153.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "There is mild tenderness in the back of the thigh and you can still straighten the knee fully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.1,
      "end_seconds": 166.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "Please sit back down. And what about swelling, pop at the time, fall or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.87,
      "end_seconds": 172.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "No, uh, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.75,
      "end_seconds": 177.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.03,
      "end_seconds": 180.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.43,
      "end_seconds": 188.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "So, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.43,
      "end_seconds": 191.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.92,
      "end_seconds": 200.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Alright, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.18,
      "end_seconds": 202.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Yes, milk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.8,
      "end_seconds": 211.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.98,
      "end_seconds": 216.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.29,
      "end_seconds": 217.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.61,
      "end_seconds": 229.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "Erm, I've had high blood pressure for five years now. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.66,
      "end_seconds": 232.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Sure. Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.24,
      "end_seconds": 237.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.99,
      "end_seconds": 239.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.72,
      "end_seconds": 246.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.38,
      "end_seconds": 250.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.08,
      "end_seconds": 258.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "Ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning. Uh, I'm on ibuprofen gel, three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.08,
      "end_seconds": 288.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.77,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this is probably a mild hamstring strain. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.04,
      "end_seconds": 291.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.36,
      "end_seconds": 303.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.79,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a mild hamstring strain, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.67,
      "end_seconds": 321.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Rest for a few days, ice it, and then ease back in with gentle stretching."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.99,
      "end_seconds": 326.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.28,
      "end_seconds": 330.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}